  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Facilities v9.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Facilities v9.0 dataset consists of health facility points with name, location, health zone, and health area, among other attributes, for all the twenty-six provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). The current version supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Facilities v8.0 < https://doi.org/10.7916/f1ft-y872 >. The following changes were made: Health facility points added. - Corrections to health facility names. This dataset should be considered operational; it has not been fully validated by government authorities. Keywords: Health Facilities",
